1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,400
It's not out of gratitude

2
00:00:02,366 --> 00:00:04,166
It's because I want to treat you well

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,466
Mr. Fu, is this a confession

4
00:00:10,166 --> 00:00:12,066
If you think so then it is

5
00:00:13,066 --> 00:00:14,033
So casual

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,000
It's not casual

7
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,033
Just afraid you'll demand proof again

8
00:00:19,266 --> 00:00:20,066
Heh

9
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:21,300
At the wedding banquet

10
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,366
Your fingers were trembling

11
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:24,200
You were so pale signing the statement

12
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,166
When Su Yurou brought out those old things

13
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,400
It's not like you didn't feel wronged

14
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,466
You just didn't let

15
00:00:33,466 --> 00:00:34,666
those feelings make decisions for you

16
00:00:35,033 --> 00:00:37,200
In my past life I found out too late that you helped me

17
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:38,866
Back then I trusted and chose the wrong people

18
00:00:38,866 --> 00:00:40,100
And put up with things I shouldn't have

19
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:40,966
So in this life

20
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,400
When I saw you in the corner at the banquet I thought

21
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,833
At least this time I can't let you slip away

22
00:00:45,033 --> 00:00:45,900
So you chose me

23
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,633
I admit I knew you would win

24
00:00:47,633 --> 00:00:48,466
But when I chose you

25
00:00:48,466 --> 00:00:49,266
you hadn't become anyone yet

26
00:00:49,266 --> 00:00:50,500
It was just you as a person

27
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,866
Worth me choosing all over again

28
00:00:53,833 --> 00:00:54,633
Su Mengyao

29
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,100
It's hard not to take you seriously when you say that

30
00:00:59,966 --> 00:01:00,000
Then take it seriously
